00:10:05.537 --> 00:10:07.206
The bill comes.

00:10:07.206 --> 00:10:10.910
So, while Sal was in
the bathroom, Q and I split.

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:14.347
We took off,
left Sal stuck with the bill.

00:10:14.347 --> 00:10:15.680
-How fast do you decide it?

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.616
Is it very much in the moment,
like, "we should just go"

00:10:17.616 --> 00:10:18.650
and both of you agree
immediately?

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:19.918
-It's kind of like
falling in love.

00:10:19.918 --> 00:10:23.955
We locked eyes and just knew,
and just knew.

00:10:23.955 --> 00:10:25.758
Yeah, we ran out
as fast as we can.

00:10:25.758 --> 00:10:27.626
-To be fair, I don't know what
I was thinking

00:10:27.626 --> 00:10:29.528
going to the bathroom
at the end of the meal.

00:10:29.528 --> 00:10:30.862
[ Laughter ]

00:10:30.862 --> 00:10:33.131
It was my fault. I asked for it.
-How much was the bill?

00:10:33.131 --> 00:10:37.135
-It was tough because, you know,
it was over 600 bucks.

00:10:37.135 --> 00:10:38.403
-Oh, my God!
-Yeah.

00:10:38.403 --> 00:10:40.439
-And he's on TV, so he's got to
tip really well.

00:10:40.439 --> 00:10:42.107
[ Laughter ]

00:10:42.107 --> 00:10:44.310
-And there's no Denzel
to chip in, no Chris Pratt.

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:45.878
[ Laughter ]

00:10:45.878 --> 00:10:47.646
-Believe me, before I put
my credit card down,

00:10:47.646 --> 00:10:49.482
I searched feverishly for
Denzel.

00:10:49.482 --> 00:10:51.316
[ Laughter ]

00:10:51.316 --> 00:10:54.086
-Gentlemen, congratulations on
another season.

00:10:54.086 --> 00:10:56.455
It really is amazing what
you guys continue to do.

00:10:56.455 --> 00:11:01.460
James Murray, Brian Quinn,
Sal Vulcano, everybody.

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:04.263
And new episodes of
"Impractical Jokers"

00:11:04.263 --> 00:11:05.398
air Thursday nights on truTV.

